sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Device as ESP32 / Device-Sim
  participant GW as Gateway Router (/attempts)
  participant Auth as Token Middleware
  participant Schema as Zod Validator (contracts)
  participant DB as SQLite WAL Database
  participant WS as WebSocket Manager (/ws/live)
  actor UI as Web Dashboard

  Note over Device,UI: Edge Decision Completed: Device evaluated Gate 1 + Gate 2

  Device->>GW: POST /api/v1/attempts<br/>Header: x-device-token: secret<br/>Body: Attempt JSON
  
  GW->>Auth: Verify x-device-token
  alt Token Missing or Invalid
    Auth-->>Device: 401 Unauthorized (Error JSON)
  else Token Valid
    Auth->>Schema: AttemptSchema.safeParse(body)
    alt Invalid Payload
      Schema-->>Device: 400 Bad Request (Validation Issues)
    else Schema Validated
      Schema->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
      DB->>DB: INSERT INTO attempts (id, outcome, score, tau, ...)
      DB->>DB: UPDATE lock_status SET failureCount, state, updatedAt
      DB->>DB: INSERT INTO audit_log (eventType, detailsJson)
      DB->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
      DB-->>GW: Transaction Committed Successfully

      GW->>WS: broadcastAttempt(attempt)
      WS-->>UI: WebSocket Frame: {"type": "attempt", "data": {...}}
      Note over UI: Zustand updates attempts[], plays sound, updates lock canvas

      GW-->>Device: 201 Created {"success": true, "attemptId": "..."}
    end
  end
